==English==

===Etymology===
{{affix|en|hypo-|oxygen|-ia|gloss1=under}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A condition in which [[tissue]]s (especially the [[blood]]) are deprived of an adequate supply of [[oxygen]]; [[anoxia]] {{defdate|from 1940s}}
# A reduced concentration of dissolved oxygen in an [[aquatic]] environment.

